                                        "entry_id": "306cf142-c1b4-3ce5-ab6c-0255d0f1d550",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being subjugated; forced control by others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71f1b0ac-dd67-4033-a690-eec5a37e76be",
                                                "sense_id": "0660d143-b241-3a0d-aa7f-0a6ffe5cb4c3",
                                                "text": "Few concepts are as emotionally charged as that of race. The word conjures up a mixture of associations—culture, ethnicity, genetics, subjugation, exclusion and persecution. But is the tragic history of efforts to define groups of people by race really a matter of the misuse of science, the abuse of a valid biological concept?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a67c5206-8eae-4b5d-8cdd-256cdb005787",
                        "source_entry_id": "d09f5658-71d9-3761-98f6-f390b9a6455a",
                        "source_sense_id": "528c9736-5293-3f5b-a8bb-412cfbe0e36b",
